f fluid freshening in the central part of the Ulleung basin, East sea. Mar Pet Geol. 2013;47:99&#x2013;112.</Citation><ArticleIdList><ArticleId IdType="doi">10.1016/j.marpetgeo.2012.12.011</ArticleId></ArticleIdList></Reference><Reference><Citation>Hesse R. Pore water anomalies of submarine gas-hydrate zones as tool to assess hydrate abundance and distribution in the subsurface: what have we learned in the past decade? Earth Sci Rev. 2003;61(1&#x2013;2):149&#x2013;79.</Citation><ArticleIdList><ArticleId IdType="doi">10.1016/S0012-8252(02)00117-4</ArticleId></ArticleIdList></Reference><Reference><Citation>Whiticar MJ. Carbon and hydrogen isotope systematics of bacterial formation and oxidation of methane. Chem Geol. 1999;161(1&#x2013;3):291&#x2013;314.</Citation><ArticleIdList><ArticleId IdType="doi">10.1016/S0009-2541(99)00092-3</ArticleId></ArticleIdList></Reference><Reference><Citation>Biddle JF, Lipp JS, Lever MA, Lloyd KG, S&#xf8;rensen KB, Anderson R, et al. Heterotrophic archaea dominate sedimentary subsurface ecosystems off Peru. Proc Natl Acad Sci. 2006;103(10):3846&#x2013;51.</Citation><ArticleIdList><ArticleId IdType="doi">10.1073/pnas.0600035103</ArticleId><ArticleId IdType="pmc">PMC1533785</ArticleId><ArticleId IdType="pubmed">16505362</ArticleId></ArticleIdList></Reference><Reference><Citation>Hamdan LJ, Gillevet PM, Pohlman JW, Sikaroodi M, Greinert J, Coffin RB. Diversity and biogeochemical structuring of bacterial communities across the Porangahau ridge accretionary prism, new Zealand. FEMS Microbiol Ecol. 2011;77(3):518&#x2013;32.</Citation><ArticleIdList><ArticleId IdType="doi">10.1111/j.1574-6941.2011.01133.x</ArticleId><ArticleId IdType="pubmed">21595727</ArticleId></ArticleIdList></Reference><Reference><Citation>Inagaki F, Nunoura T, Nakagawa S, Teske A, Lever M, Lauer A, et al. Biogeographical distribution and diversity of microbes in methane hydrate-bearing deep marine sediments on the Pacific ocean margin. Proc Natl Acad Sci. 2006;103(8):2815